  "reasoning": "The facts describe two distinct criminal conduct. First, the defendant Lan repeatedly obtained money and goods from multiple victims by false pretenses of arranging student loans, amounting to 110,703 yuan, which constitutes fraud (诈骗罪) with a large sum. Second, the defendant forged a bank deposit certificate of RMB 20,000, which is the crime of forging financial tickets (伪造金融票证罪). Both crimes are clearly established, so the appropriate charges are fraud and forgery of financial documents.",
